# The on-device embedding model is a build artifact, not committed to git —
# same convention as vendor/whisper and vendor/audiocap. Populate it with
# `node apps/x/scripts/embeddings-fetch.mjs`; the release job runs that before
# packaging and forge stages the result into Resources/embeddings/.
#
# Architecture-independent, so unlike whisper/audiocap there is no per-arch
# subdirectory.
model.onnx
vocab.txt
*.tmp
